# WP-OPT-SPIKE-3 (owner 11-22 "What about WP?"): frames over 100 ms during the WP_Protocol flight with no cell
# load/unload (WP-FAR-9 frames worst 141.7 ms, median 45 ms; stream <= 4 ms, eviction <= 2 ms). UE `stat hitches`:
# every published profiler window of a --flight now prints its [Hitch] lines (frames over 1.5x the window median with
# their five largest self scopes, ProfilerWindow::LogHitches), so each spike in the CSV names its owner.
# [flight_after] is the headless flight profiler (ShotOptions --flight), the same line as WP-OPT-EVICT-BATCH:
#   Editor --project Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce --play
#          --flight line:-90000,5000,0:90000,5000,0 --flight-speed 6000 --flight-csv <scratch>/flight-after.csv
#   -> editor.log «[Flight] window N» + «[Hitch]» per window, «[Flight] ... max» summary.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Когда run Action "Play"
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Тогда flight_after Play над WP_Protocol, панель Profiler в кадре: худший кадр окна ≤ 60 мс (до: 141.7 мс); ландшафт без дыр; editor.log «[Hitch]» называет владельца каждого кадра > 100 мс
Когда run Action "Stop"
